✗ Attack paths (2)
────────────────────

 LOW   Attack path 2
       Entry  https://get.example.com/install.sh (script downloaded and run at build time)
       │
       └──▶ runs in job `build` from workflow `reusable.yml`
            └─▶ reaches code execution on the runner; nothing else proven

       So     if this script is compromised or malicious,
              an attacker can execute code on an ephemeral runner
       Fix    download the script, check its checksum, then run it
       ↳ details: run `plumber explain -a 2`

